    {
      "id": "battle_smith",
      "name": "Battle-smith / in-run upgrade",
      "description": "sharpen your tools mid-fight - upgrades as a combat resource (the Armaments fantasy). A skill carries `{\"op\":\"upgrade_card\",\"cards\":\"choose\"}` (YOU pick one card in hand - the true Armaments feel), `\"cards\":\"random\"` (upgrade one random card in hand), or `\"cards\":\"all\"` (upgrade the whole hand, a strong uncommon+). COMBAT-SCOPED: upgrades last this combat only, so lean on retain or big/refilling hands so an upgraded card sticks around to matter; a rare power can run a `turn_start`-> `upgrade_card` (random) engine. 1-2 upgrade cards per class.",
