    {
      "id": "madness_discard",
      "name": "Madness / discard-matters",
      "description": "churn your hand - discard as fuel, cards that reward being thrown away (Reflex). Three tools: `{\"op\":\"discard\",\"amount\":1}` throws random cards from hand (a cost/enabler; pair with draw); `{\"op\":\"add_trigger\",\"trigger\":\"on_discard\",...}` is the Reflex payoff that fires when THAT card is effect-discarded (keep discard-fuel cards in hand and pitch them for value); and `{\"op\":\"scry\",\"amount\":3}` looks at the top N of your draw pile and discards any (a draw-filter that also lets you CHOOSE which fuel card to pitch - scry-discards trigger on_discard too). Ship discard income + a couple of on_discard fuel cards + a scry/churn engine.",
      "metaphors": [
